  <running_head>INSTITUTIONUM</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">advertantur, atque ex constructione</l>
    <l n="2">sua ostendant, quod excrementorum</l>
    <l n="3">cerebri expurgationi destinati sint.</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" para="true">XVI. <i>Liberum omnium sensuum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>exercitium vigiliarum nomine venit, sed</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>somnus ligatio maxime externorum sen-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>suum est, in quo cum operantur interni</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>sensus infomnium appellatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">§. 1. De his breviter quædam dice-</l>
    <l n="10">mus. Et ut à vigiliis initium capiamus:</l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Vigiliæ sunt liberum omnium sensuum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>interiorum &amp; exteriorum exercitium.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">Unde patet, quod non sint adjunctum</l>
    <l n="14">quoddam sensuum, sed quod sint po-</l>
    <l n="15">tius ipsæ sensationes conjunctim sum-</l>
    <l n="16">ptæ in opere. Accidunt vero vigiliæ,</l>
    <l n="17">quia libere spiritus animales ab inte-</l>
    <l n="18">rioribus ad exteriora sensoria influunt.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">At vero influunt, quia &amp; sufficientes</l>
    <l n="20">sunt, &amp; non sunt impediti. Finis est</l>
    <l n="21">animalis salus, quandoquidem ad hanc</l>
    <l n="22">sensus dati sunt. Verum intelligendum</l>
    <l n="23">id venit, de vigiliis naturalibus, præ-</l>
    <l n="24">ternaturales enim valde animal debili-</l>
    <l n="25">tant, &amp; in varios morbos conjiciunt.</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">Eæ proveniunt ex magna spirituum ir-</l>
    <l n="27">ritatione &amp; effusione præternaturali,</l>
    <l n="28">seu illa irritantia &amp; concitantia inte-</l>
    <l n="29">riores partes immediate contingant,</l>
    <l n="30">ut accidit in febribus, in qua plurimæ</l>
    <l n="31">cva-</l>
  </main_text>
